'''Bladesoul''' is a [[Mob]] and {{MobCategory|mb}} that spawns in the {{Zone|Stronghold}} area in a small, circular arena to the right of the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}} entrance. 

== Spawning ==
'''Bladesoul''' spawns around 5 minutes after being defeated at {{Coords|-295|83|-518}}.

==Behavior== 
*Bladesoul will attack one player at a time using its [[Ragnarock]], dealing {{Stat|dmg|3,000}} on hit.
*Bladesoul will sometimes shoot wither skulls at all nearby players, dealing {{Stat|Damage|7,500}} on hit.
*Occasionally, Bladesoul will shoot a ring of wither skulls directly outward, instantly killing any player they hit (can't be nullified by abilities, such as the esoward invulnerable). Before the attack, a circle of particles appears around Bladesoul.
*Bladesoul will sometimes turn a nearby block into a Block of Coal, which deals {{Stat|damage}} to players who stand on top of it. After 10 seconds, a Wither Guard will be spawned, and Bladesoul's {{stat|hp}} will be increased by {{Green|12,500,000}}. While the Wither Guard is alive, it increases Bladesoul's maximum {{Stat|hp}} by {{Green|12,500,000}}. After the Wither Guard has died, Bladesoul loses {{Green|12,500,000}} {{Stat|hp}} and maximum {{Stat|hp}}. 
**The Wither Guard has {{Stat|hp|5,000,000}} and deals {{Stat|dmg|4,000}}. It quickly runs towards nearby players.
**If Bladesoul's {{Stat|hp}} is over {{Green|100,000,000}}, he will become invincible until his maximum {{Stat|hp}} is below {{Green|100,000,000}}.

