== Trivia ==
*The Bladesoul's lore states that the blaze on its head is the corpse of one of its enemies that the Bladesoul defeated: ''A giant wither skeleton who rules over the stronghold after defeating the strongest of the Blazes in it, now wearing his body as a crown.''
*According to the Bestiary Lore, the Bladesoul used to be a prince.

